              highlighted: ["MN","NO"] },
            { text: "It is next to be proved that it is also a second bimedial straight line.",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["MO"] },
            { text: "Since {DE} is incommensurable in length with {AB}, that is, with {EK},",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["ED","AB","EK"] },
